sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Guard as Tenant Admin (TENANT_ADMIN)
    participant FE as Frontend (use-websocket.ts)
    participant WS as STOMP Broker (/ws)
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Guard->>FE: open /gate/[gateId] kiosk view
    FE->>WS: SockJS connect + SUBSCRIBE<br/>/topic/gate/{gateId}/check
    FE->>API: GET /api/gates/{id}/recent-checks
    API->>DB: query recent VehicleLog rows for gate
    DB-->>API: recent checks
    API-->>FE: recent-checks list (replay missed events)
    loop on each vehicle check event
        API->>WS: broadcast to /topic/vehicle-check<br/>and /topic/gate/{gateId}/check
        WS-->>FE: push VehicleLog event (plate, type, imagePath)
        FE-->>Guard: render entry/exit card + TTS (Web Speech vi-VN)
    end
    Guard->>FE: check /gate/health dashboard
    FE->>API: GET gate status (online/offline/disabled,<br/>lastHeartbeatAt)

    Note over Guard,DB: TODAY (§1): in-memory SimpleBroker, single backend<br/>instance, evidence snapshot image only (no live video)
    Note over Guard,DB: TARGET adds: Live Camera view (HLS/WebRTC via<br/>media gateway, MJPEG fallback) embedded in kiosk,<br/>Redis pub-sub STOMP relay so operators across multiple<br/>backend instances see the same live gate feed
